flowchart TD
  app[Application composition] --> catalog[Application catalog and trusted policy]
  app --> bridge[Public MCP view contract]
  bridge -->|delivered presentation input| decoder[Core A2UI decoder]
  decoder -->|validated message cases| session[Core processor session]
  catalog --> session
  session -->|surface state| lit[Lit mounting and bindings]
  lit --> view[Application components and actions]
  decoder -->|invalid input| fallback[Clear affected view and safe fallback]
  session -->|rejected update| fallback
  fallback --> view
  app --> dispose[Explicit disposal]
  dispose -->|retire delivery| bridge
  dispose -->|release subscriptions and state| session
  dispose -->|unmount| lit
  lynx[Bounded Lynx Web investigation] -.->|informs neutral contracts| session
